[h2]Update[/h2]

[b]Changes[/b]
[list]
[*]A culture can now hold only one marriage tradition: the wife traditions can no longer be combined with each other, or with Monogamous, Concubines or Polygamous.
[*]Replacing one marriage tradition with another through culture reform now works.
[*]Secrets of the Higher Mysteries can now detect this mod and offer its traditions.
[*]Updated for AGOT 0.5.2.1 (CK3 1.19.0.6).
[/list]
